  "label": "Motivational Cliché",
  "description": "The phrase 'this project is tough but it will save the world' is a common motivational trope used to justify difficult or arduous tasks by framing them as noble or world-saving. This cliché is often used in modern contexts to inspire perseverance, but when paired with imagery of genocide, it becomes exploitative and disrespectful.",
